# Corpus-diversity single-block combat: Wandering Tombshell (1/6) attacks,
# Warpath Ghoul (3/2) blocks -- vanilla stats, no keywords, neither dies.
# CR 510.1b: a single live blocker exchanges full power for full power
# automatically, no decision needed (dealAttackerDamage, combatdamage.go).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
